# Tahoe live image package list (x86_64). archiso hard-requires mkinitcpio
# and mkinitcpio-archiso in this list.
#
# STATUS: desktop session added 2026-10-18, ISO still unbuilt. See
# docs/iso-session.md for the honest list of what was and was not verified.

# ── base ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
base
linux
linux-firmware
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
syslinux
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
pacman
archlinux-keyring
sudo

# ── first-party packages ([tahoe] repo, see packages/) ──────────────
tahoe-base
tahoe-compositor
tahoe-uel

# ── execution layers + portals ──────────────────────────────────────
flatpak
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-utils
polkit

# ── the desktop: Hyprland + MacShell ────────────────────────────────
hyprland
hyprlock
hyprpaper
quickshell
qt6-shadertools
qt6-svg

# ── sound ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pipewire
wireplumber
pipewire-pulse

# ── network / bluetooth ─────────────────────────────────────────────
networkmanager
bluez
bluez-utils

# ── shell helpers mentioned by MacShell's README ────────────────────
kitty
thunar
papirus-icon-theme
inter-font
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
cliphist
wf-recorder
libnotify
brightnessctl
inotify-tools
xorg-xwayland
zenity
fastfetch
